request.description:
**GET /timeTableCreate/**

Lists class sections nested **year → classSection → semester** with `timeTableRoutines[]` on each semester.

**Optional query:** `courseId`, `sessionId`.

When `courseId` is sent, all program years are returned. Each year lists its class sections; each section lists all semesters (terms) for that year — empty `timeTableRoutines: []` where no placement exists.

**Response root:** `courseId`, `sessionId`, `courseName`, `termType`, `years[]` → `classSections[]` → `semesters[]`.

**Example:**
```json
{
  "courseId": 53,
  "sessionId": 27,
  "courseName": "B.Arch",
  "termType": "Sem",
  "years": [
    {
      "year": 1,
      "classSections": [
        {
          "classSectionsId": 101,
          "section": "A",
          "year": 1,
          "semesters": [
            {
              "term": 1,
              "termName": "Semester 1",
              "classSectionTermId": 1001,
              "classSectionsId": 101,
              "timeTableRoutines": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```
